   "text": "\"Her voice was sweet, her manners refined and agreeable. She was raised in a good family as a nurse and seamstress. When the family became suddenly financially embarrassed, she was sold onto a plantation in Louisiana. She has often told me how, without any warning, she was suddenly forced into a carriage, and heard her little mistress screaming and stretching her hands toward her as she was driven away.",
